    "ruleType": "weapon-ability",
    "group": "Core",
    "summary": "**[Conversion](vsdata:weapon-ability/conversion)**. The trigger range depends on the weapon, so use the linked version: [beyond 12″ with a successful roll](vsdata:weapon-ability/conversion) on the Hekaton Land Fortress's SP heavy conversion beamer; [beyond 12″ even when the roll is not a success](vsdata:weapon-ability/conversion-12-without-success), on the War Dog Moirax's and Armiger Moirax's Conversion beam cannon and the Brôkhyr Thunderkyn's SP conversion beamer; [beyond 18″ from the bearer with a successful roll](vsdata:weapon-ability/conversion-18) on the Knight Defender's Conversion beam obliterator; [beyond 24″ from the bearer with a successful roll](vsdata:weapon-ability/conversion-24) on the Chaos Acastus Knight Asterius's and Acastus Knight Asterius's Twin conversion beam cannon. In each, the qualifying Hit roll shows 4 or higher before modifiers and scores a Critical Hit.",
